===Pronunciation 2===
* {{IPA|/ˈʊntɐˌʃʁaɪ̯bən/|[ˈʔʊntɐˌʃʁaɪ̯bən]|[-ˌʃʁaɪ̯bm̩]|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|un|ter|schrei|ben|lang=de}}

====Verb====
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|schreibt unter|schrieb unter|untergeschrieben|past subjunctive=schriebe unter}}

# {{lb|de|obsolete}} to [[sign]]
# {{lb|de|rather|_|rare}} to [[write]] under or below something
#: {{ux|de|Um das Iota der langen Diphthonge in einer griechischen Handschrift hinzuzufügen, war man gezwungen, es '''unterzuschreiben'''.|In order to add the iota of the long diphthongs in a Greek manuscript, one was constrained to '''write''' it '''below''' [the line].}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The form in which sense 2 most commonly occurs is the past participle, {{m|de|untergeschrieben}}.

